      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "text": "Temporal guarantee: every read in Azure Container Apps is scoped to the latest committed Azure Cosmos DB manifest. Source turns, facts, trees, embeddings, traces, Azure AI Search documents, and Azure Blob snapshots are versioned by tenant/user/forest generation, so Azure services scale the system without flattening MemForest into a plain vector store.",
